{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tokenExchange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actorToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scopes"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"audience"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"resource"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14ExchangedTokenV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ExchangedToken"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"subjectToken","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The token being exchanged — positional and first, because four"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optional strings in positional order is a bug waiting to be written."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"subjectTokenType","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What kind of token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subjectToken"},{"text":" is. ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Required","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (§15.1), with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no default: a default would be this SDK choosing which kind of credential the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller holds, which is what §15.7 forbids. Pass ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/accessTokenType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same-domain exchange, or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/jwtTokenType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a trusted external issuer’s JWT","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(§15.7). This SDK never reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subjectToken"},{"text":" to decide the value: which kind of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"token the caller holds is only the caller’s to know, AXIAM refuses refresh and ID","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"token types by name, and a refusal is never retried as a different type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"actorToken","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"its presence selects delegation; its absence selects impersonation.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Two different operations with different risk, and §15.2 rule 1 forbids papering over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the difference: this SDK supplies no default actor token and never substitutes its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own session for one. Passing nothing here asks for impersonation, and the server","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses unless this client holds that grant.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The actor token must have been issued to this client","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 9, contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"1.60): obtain it with the same client’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/loginClientCredentials(scope:tenantID:configuration:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grant and pass its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcTokenSet\/accessToken","type":"reference"},{"text":" here — its ","type":"text"},{"code":"sub","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is this client’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A token issued to another client, a console sign-in or a service","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account is answered ","type":"text"},{"code":"400","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_request","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (“actor_token was not issued to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exchanging client”), which surfaces unchanged: not retried, not rewritten into an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"impersonation, and not repaired by substituting a token of this SDK’s own.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"scopes","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Omit to inherit the subject’s, bounded by this client’s registration. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken\/scope"},{"type":"text","text":" is what was actually granted, which may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrower than what was asked for even on success (§15.2 rule 7) — read it."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What this deliberately does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" do:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No retry, downgrade or rewrite on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unauthorized_client"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 2). It means"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either “this client may not exchange at all” or “this client may not impersonate”;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both are registration facts an operator must fix, and reworking the request into a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegation would send one the caller did not write."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No auto-narrowing on "},{"code":"invalid_scope","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 3). The server refuses rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"silently narrowing precisely so the caller finds out here.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No refresh token, ever","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 4). ","type":"text"},{"code":"TokenExchangeResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no such field,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" has nowhere to put one, and this result never enters the §9","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single-flight refresh guard. Re-run the exchange to get a fresh token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No adoption","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 5). The exchanged token is not this client’s session — not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"even behind an opt-in flag, which is a MUST NOT here where adoption elsewhere is a MAY."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is a token to hand onward in one outbound call; adopting it would silently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-privilege every subsequent call this client makes."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A cross-tenant subject token answers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_grant"},{"type":"text","text":", and this SDK does not try to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguish “wrong tenant” from “bad token” (§15.3): the server collapses them because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"telling them apart is a tenant-enumeration signal."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC13tokenExchange12subjectToken0fG4Type05actorG06scopes8audience8resource8tenantID13configurationAA09ExchangedG0VAA9SensitiveVySSG_SSAQSgSaySSGSgSSSgA2uA17OidcConfigurationVSgtYaKF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tokenExchange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actorToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scopes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"audience","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resource","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"t