documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/accessTokenType":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/accessTokenType","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"}],"title":"accessTokenType","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor_token_type"},{"type":"text","text":" this SDK sends, and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subject_token_type"},{"type":"text","text":" a caller names for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same-domain exchange of §15.1. There is no default: the type is a required"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/accesstokentype","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"}}}